From 4f045fa9fa010ba2980bf8713174860a4fe2c718 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 21:31:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix inspection photo bug, redesign to 9-shot AI comparison,
 renumber trips

Drivers' inspection updates were silently blocked by RLS (no driver UPDATE
policy on vehicle_inspections), so photos never reached the owner. Adds the
missing policy and backfills affected historical rows.

Redesigns inspection capture to 6 exterior + 3 interior shots matching the
requested layout, lets owners attach per-car reference photos before a
rental starts, and updates the Gemini analysis edge function to compare
each inspection shot against the owner's own reference photo for that car
(falling back to listing photos when none exists) instead of generic
car-match logic.

Trip lists now show sequential numbers instead of driver names, with
icons on distance/duration/top-speed stats.
